{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976610/extras/a842509f8908bd353101b1fb0b153c17.avif?t=1764835382\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976610/extras_big/a842509f8908bd353101b1fb0b153c17.webp?t=1764835382 width=1560 height=367 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Myth of Valderit</strong> is a psychological horror experience set in \u201c<strong>Valderit</strong>\u201d, a cursed village, inspired by the abandoned Catalan village of La Mussara. You wake up as Nil, separated from your friends, Julia and Enric, and soon discover the dark secrets of this cursed village\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976610/extras/18092d61c948cd2e2f1cd69871d3b61c.poster.avif?t=1764835382\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976610/extras/18092d61c948cd2e2f1cd69871d3b61c.webm?t=1764835382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976610/extras/610bf85d2c309c0c9d620ada56c0c3e4.avif?t=1764835382\" width=760 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player, first-person experience, Myth of Valderit combines exploration, survival elements, and puzzle-solving. Nil will have to survive and avoid being chased by the sect of Slygaroth without no weapon to defend from them.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the things that are waiting for you in <strong>Valderit</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976610/extras/c0dd17b9c11bcfa2ec440cab580158c8.avif?t=1764835382\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976610/extras/c36cde9b3599fdd1f6791dffcee9c76c.avif?t=1764835382\" width=760 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976610/extras/d7784a22dde85885641c5d0917d895eb.poster.avif?t=1764835382\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976610/extras/d7784a22dde85885641c5d0917d895eb.webm?t=1764835382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976610/extras/cf8039dbf3d6db14ce32f2163c921f6b.avif?t=1764835382\" width=760 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>To advance in the story and know more about what is happening</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976610/extras/5679a23f2de0a77ccac1e46f1f8197a5.poster.avif?t=1764835382\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976610/extras/5679a23f2de0a77ccac1e46f1f8197a5.webm?t=1764835382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976610/extras/45b57a3407a198429e393c726cf2f196.avif?t=1764835382\" width=760 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With an <strong>innovative Adaptative System</strong>, <strong>that analyses how you react to fear and adapts the game in real time:</strong> level layouts shift, music and atmosphere, even the placement of threats changes according to your behaviour. You will face the game in your own way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976610/extras/79f1605b9e7f64b44039a02b65c9a173.avif?t=1764835382\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976610/extras/6fdf669f2fb669ac695a2fc1f3e4e13a.avif?t=1764835382\" width=760 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique sanity mechanic distorts perception, walls move, sounds deceive, objects that change place and visions twist what you believe to be real. These elements ensure that the game offers new encounters and perspectives, keeping tension alive across multiple playthroughs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976610/extras/38b45888afacceb9ed537b0925ca21dc.avif?t=1764835382\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976610/extras/e874ae88d287c5292cd1741da93a3172.avif?t=1764835382\" width=760 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>Lovecraftian inspired</strong> narrative will take you into one trip of friends that starts in the forest next to Valderit, after a few beers the group of friends go to sleep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And in the blink of an eye the little adventure takes Nil back in time <strong>to 1693.</strong> Where he will find the old church, and a cursed town with his houses and his catacombs. Between a dense atmosphere he will discover the darker side of reality.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shadows whisper, rituals leave disturbing traces, and an ancient presence that watches his every step and wants to kill him. In this journey you must decide whether to run, face the unknown, or even sacrifice yourself\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976610/extras/0b833de6ce3daeb08c879fda52d40e7e.avif?t=1764835382\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976610/extras/a986c855574215f469c3378e00a4152a.avif?t=1764835382\" width=760 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loom Studios </strong>invites you into an adventure where fear is never the same twice. Step into Valderit and uncover its truth\u2026 if you dare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976610/extras/783fb94946fc39e438da978dcb1e216d.webp?t=1764835382\" width=1560 height=12 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">See our social media links on this page.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Follow us and become part of the Myth!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Press Contact:</strong>\u00a0<a href=\"mailto:loomstudiosbcn@gmail.com\">loomstudiosbcn@gmail.com</a>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3976610?t=1764835382","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3976610?t=1764835382","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976610/aba87879c4ed650314021e7a99ff749f03f10fa6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764835382","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976610/aba87879c4ed650314021e7a99ff749f03f10fa6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764835382","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"In this game, no type of violence, sexual content, or sensitive content is shown directly.\r\nHowever, the results of acts of violence that took place before the player arrives at certain locations will be visible, such as corpses and skeletons.\r\n\r\nThere is a single instance where adults aged 21+ can be seen consuming alcohol.\r\n\r\nThe only crime understood to occur in the game is murder (committed by those who are clearly identified as villains).\r\nIn this regard, we would like to emphasize two points:\r\n\r\nAt no time will murders be shown being carried out.\r\n\r\nIt is fiction and a fundamental part of the game to create a horror atmosphere. The team is completely against any kind of murder or aggression toward any person or animal, and we strongly condemn it.\r\n\r\nThere will be no form of apology for, or depiction of, sexual themes or suicide.\r\nFurthermore, we want to stress that we do not promote any type of crime, or discrimination.\r\nThere is no political opinion expressed, either in favor of or against anyone."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976610/extras/a842509f8908bd353101b1fb0b153c17.avif?t=1764835382\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976610/extras_big/a842509f8908bd353101b1fb0b153c17.webp?t=1764835382 width=1560 height=367 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Myth of Valderit</strong> is a psychological horror experience set in \u201c<strong>Valderit</strong>\u201d, a cursed village, inspired by the abandoned Catalan village of La Mussara. You wake up as Nil, separated from your friends, Julia and Enric, and soon discover the dark secrets of this cursed village\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976610/extras/18092d61c948cd2e2f1cd69871d3b61c.poster.avif?t=1764835382\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976610/extras/18092d61c948cd2e2f1cd69871d3b61c.webm?t=1764835382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" sty